## Execution
Runs: batch

Submit `scripts/submit.sh` through `python3 <workspace>/_system/executorlib.py submit --workspace <project> <script>` using the project's configured executor. Request 1 CPU, 4 GB RAM and 10 minutes; expected runtime is under 5 minutes for this six-sample matrix and the output should be under 5 MB. Resolve inputs within the batch job, source the workspace environment, and run `scripts/sample_pca.py` with the resolved paths. All scripts, logs and results stay in this analysis directory. If required tools or resources are unavailable, stop and report the failure without installing packages or substituting execution venues. After success, use `stage03_analysis.py verify` to check the declared figure and register completion; append its returned history entry verbatim as the stage contract requires. Nothing executes before explicit user approval of this plan.
